# This sample uses fictional Northwind case data.
# You do not need Salesforce, Anthropic, or other API keys to run it.
#
# Claude Desktop uses your own signed-in account. Do not put that token here.
#
# If you later bind live org data, keep secrets only on your machine:
# SF_CLIENT_ID=
# SF_CLIENT_SECRET=
# SF_USERNAME=
# SF_PASSWORD=
# SF_SECURITY_TOKEN=
#
# Never commit a filled .env, .sfdx/, or Connected App secret.
